ap=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yq0bwxewLPkQ7kNvwFlj6Us&_nc_oc=Adpr-EDOQfTshHO6Wp2ZzZ7aKIfbOrNMPa7Zxqnfv7GHt0UKcbrDYwsDrN92DeEpJJM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTVCQVMJ-ZeZDLORQTJ1fYt69D451KAQpkb9gvqGfltZA&oe=6AFDD414"}, {"file_name": "5_Meta_screenShot_project.png", "id": "1793794835174806", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622916_1793794838508139_4579717630808155575_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z9IgEIlzWmMQ7kNvwG9Zq41&_nc_oc=Adqkof6ZOSj6gZU4pxwkABVxHRua-J5L2D0mYOBqPZsxkj3HdupfI978KkZEkEeTA9Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTY40uy38H05FlGD-pYt2LAHmhajR7Z1vpXZ18EZMPQgg&oe=6AFDC321"}, {"file_name": "4_Meta_screenShot_project (1).png", "id": "1110729798361843", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620532_1110729801695176_7063291144404931049_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mljV-mjTjs0Q7kNvwHIS-bF&_nc_oc=Adqq_C8OCgeb2pzuPnlZuovykedYIdnN0UlwQcfBeq6ZrAF7_dE1V0K1pFnMgM5bouI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQcrHclIc4N2m4ZX1na4GFsrju-fuVBK5n7coNvTyzNcQ&oe=6AFDBE4C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Meta_hero_project.png", "id": "1818410125948021", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593919959_1818410129281354_7820014809212952754_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KVlMWhjI8IMQ7kNvwGDgwMS&_nc_oc=AdqjjpfGW6OEIxPoPcpiOhHi5SlaGd14mj_-NnpxTufs-gqd7eXpJLla_F9wjj0_mUo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT0JtfnQPZs_6rvm7ithn6SNjdLIp43zXebot5CMyl6QA&oe=6AFDB3CC"}, "display_name": "Glitch Glide City", "keywords": ["online", "free", "casual", "action", "arcade"], "long_description": "\ud83c\udf06 Glitch Glide City: Raise It. Battle It. Take the Crown.\n\nThe Champion let the Glitches in.\n\nGlitch City was once a perfect digital world. Now corrupted Glitches crash through its streets, and the Champion sits on top of it all. You're about to raise the DigiBot who'll help take the city back.\n\n{2535935110223326}\n\n\n\ud83e\udd5a Hatch Your DigiBot\n\nPick an egg. Feed it by hand until it hatches, and meet the companion that's yours and yours alone.\n\n\ud83c\udf56 It Becomes What It Eats\n\nEvery feed changes it, right in front of you.\nSpiky food grows horns, spines and claws.\nZippy food grows wings, fins and antennae.\nRare Shiny food unlocks glowing patterns and rare mutations.\nWhat you hunt decides what it becomes. No two DigiBots are the same.\n\n{1408042744501013}\n\n\ud83c\udf19 It Grows While You Sleep\n\nLog off, and tomorrow see what it's become. Baby. Kid. Teen. Adult. Then it lays an egg, and the next generation inherits its rarest trait.\n\n\u2694\ufe0f Hunt the Glitches\n\nGlide, swing and climb across rooftops to reach rare food. Throw your DigiBot's attacks, back it up with your own weapons, and watch it take Glitches on up close.\n\n{1135414695663819}\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 Battle to the Top\n\nChallenge trainers. Beat the Gym Leaders. Earn every badge. Only one player can defeat the Champion and take their place.\n\n\ud83c\udfe1 Build Your Park\n\nYour home in the city. Your DigiBot sleeps here, retired DigiBots roam here, and every trophy you win goes on show. Decorate it your way, then visit anyone's Park.\n\n{1096986953118286}\n\n\ud83d\udc65 Free. Social. Always On.\n\nPlay free with friends, or meet new digizens in a city that never stops.\n\n", "short_description": "\ud83e\udd5a Hatch a DigiBot. Feed it. Watch it EVOLVE.\n\n\ud83c\udf06 Glide, swing and climb through a neon VR city overrun by Glitches. Hunt them for food. Every bite changes how your DigiBot grows, and it evolves overnight while you sleep. Battle trainers, beat the Gym Leaders and play free with friends. Only one can be Champion."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_pr